comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-17T18:31:44.721Z",codex-sol,"Job 134073515707 ran 1013 tests with no failures; the fatal step is changelog:check tracker_changed drift. The source-server.js error is an expected failure-path test and proxy ValidationErrors are nonfatal direct-mode diagnostics. Preserve default no proxy trust, prove explicit loopback trust resists earlier forged hops, fix the stale default comment, and launch the emitted server when the extension runs from source."
  "2026-11-17T18:55:48.753Z",codex-sol,"Typecheck, lint, build and build:test pass; the focused proxy/bootstrap selection passes 29/29 through pm. The broader direct-reference selection exposed a 300-second catalog-install acceptance timeout on the degraded connection, followed by a source-mode cascade. Repeating that file with the existing PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=4 harness setting; product timeouts and assertions are unchanged."
